  "name": "HL · Monday payment reminders",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HL · Monday payment reminders (Lesson 3.3)\nMonday 09:00: unpaid invoices minus anyone who has paid (Merge, keep non-matches from Input 1), set aside anyone with no phone (Fix list), then remind in batches of 20 with a 60 s wait, and email Tolu one summary.\n\n\"Send (log)\" only writes to a Sent log sheet: no message reaches a customer. A real messaging node comes in 3.4 / Boss 3.\n\n**Credentials:** Google Sheets (OAuth2) in all four Sheets nodes; Gmail (OAuth2) in Summary email.\n**Placeholders:** YOUR_SHEET_ID (tabs Invoices, Payments, Fix list, Sent log), YOUR_EMAIL (Tolu's address) in Summary email.\n\n**Test first:** batch size 2 and wait 5 s. Put them back to 20 and 60 before publishing.",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "51e26622-f782-4f0e-bd49-0e11cd47ac52",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -484,
        -234
      ]
    },
    {
