    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Loop wiring (check these three)\n- **loop** output → Build message → Send (log) → Wait 60 s → **back into Loop Over Items**. Without that last wire only the first batch goes.\n- The Wait is inside the loop, not on done.\n- **done** carries every item, so Summary email has **Execute Once** on (Settings): one email, not 200.\n\nMerge: Combine by matching fields, customer_id on both sides, keep non-matches, output from Input 1. If Payments renames its column (customerId), pick that field on the Input 2 side; never rename the sheet.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "822ea5d1-b173-41db-b4b5-a1e4763faef5",
      "name": "Loop wiring",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1320,
        234
      ]
    }
